style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm1-pbs-ses"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-pbs-usl" value="" style="endArrow=none;startArrow=diamondThin;startFill=1;startSize=16;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prk-cm1-pbs" target="prk-cm1-usl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-pbs-usl-l0" value="1" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm1-pbs-usl"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-pbs-usl-l1" value="0..1 usulan" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm1-pbs-usl"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-usl-rng" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=10;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.8;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prk-cm1-usl" target="prk-cm1-rng"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1100" y="852"/><mxPoint x="1100" y="840"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-usl-rng-l0" value="*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm1-usl-rng"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-usl-rng-l1" value="1 ruang" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm1-usl-rng"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Notasi&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick 2024, Bab 8–11)&lt;br&gt;• Hanya konsep, atribut primitif, dan asosiasi: &lt;b&gt;tanpa method, tanpa detail Odoo&lt;/b&gt;, tanpa atribut &lt;code&gt;*_id&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Garis polos = asosiasi; label di ujung = &lt;i&gt;peran&lt;/i&gt; + multiplisitas. Belah ketupat hitam = komposisi (bagian–keseluruhan).&lt;br&gt;• Segitiga kosong biru = generalisasi; nama miring «abstract» = konsep abstrak.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/nama&lt;/code&gt; = atribut/asosiasi turunan (dihitung, hanya dibaca); panah terbuka = asosiasi turunan satu arah.&lt;br&gt;• Kotak abu-abu putus-putus = konsep yang dirinci di halaman/dokumen lain. (O) = lapis Pelengkap.&lt;br&gt;• Tipe primitif: Date, DateTime, Jam, Natural, Real, Persen, Boolean, String, Text, URL, Berkas, Interval&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; (CM-1)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1230" width="640" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Atribut dan asosiasi turunan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/is_terpublikasi&lt;/code&gt; = PenetapanJadwal periode kelasnya berstatus disahkan (AB-PRK-06); &lt;code&gt;/tanggal_publikasi&lt;/code&gt; = tanggal sah.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/is_ditunda&lt;/code&gt; = ada PerubahanSesi atas sesi ini dengan /status = diajukan.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/sesi_asal&lt;/code&gt; = PerubahanSesi yang keputusannya menghasilkan sesi ini → sesinya. &lt;code&gt;/is_diganti&lt;/code&gt; = ada sesi lain yang /sesi_asal-nya sesi ini (pola &lt;i&gt;superseding&lt;/i&gt;, §11.9.2).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/is_terlewat&lt;/code&gt; = status terjadwal ∧ tanggal &amp;lt; hari ini ∧ tanpa jurnal terkirim (§9.3.1).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/melebihi_kapasitas&lt;/code&gt; = kelas.jumlah_mahasiswa &amp;gt; ruang.kapasitas (AB-PRK-03). &lt;code&gt;/berasisten&lt;/code&gt;: CM-3. &lt;code&gt;/memenuhi_pkg15…18&lt;/code&gt; = cek C/S/B per sesi (AB-PRK-32).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/status&lt;/code&gt; Pengajuan = ditarik bila ada Penarikan; hasil Keputusan bila ada; selain itu diajukan (kejadian sebagai konsep, §9.3.2)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="1230" width="620" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-n3" value="&lt;b&gt;Invarian&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Kelas unik per (mata kuliah, periode, nama).&lt;br&gt;• Satu sesi asli per (kelas, pertemuan_ke); pertemuan 8 = uts, 16 = uas (AB-PRK-02).&lt;br&gt;• Dua Sesi terjadwal, atau Sesi dan PemakaianLab disetujui, di ruang sama tidak beririsan waktu (AB-PRK-01).&lt;br&gt;• Paling banyak satu PenetapanJadwal per Periode (AB-PRK-05).&lt;br&gt;• Hasil ditolak ⇒ alasan terisi (AB-PRK-10). Keputusan dan Penarikan tidak keduanya ada.&lt;br&gt;• UsulanPengganti ada ⇔ jenis = pindah; sesi_pengganti ada ⇔ disetujui ∧ pindah (AB-PRK-12)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="1230" width="500" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-n4" value="&lt;b&gt;Pengaju&lt;/b&gt; PemakaianLab = laboran yang mencatat; pemohon (tanpa akun) hanya nama dan unit. &lt;b&gt;Rekaman konflik&lt;/b&gt; (PKG-15 bukti 5, KF-PRK-11) bukan konsep: laporan dari Keputusan ditolak karena_bentrok dan PerubahanSesi disetujui. Jam = jam dalam hari." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1370" width="640" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm1-n5" value="Bahan kerja (tidak masuk proposal). Sumber: kamus DTO dan katalog operasi ssd-praktikum.md; AB-PRK-01–34 expanded-use-case-praktikum.md; kontrak-core.md (16 Nov 2026). Rincian: rancangan/conceptual-model-praktikum.md · Draf 16 Nov 2026 · Herrens" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="1405" width="1140" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="prk-cm2" name="CM TO-BE (2-4) - Versi Modul dan Kesiapan Sesi"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1720" pageHeight="1150" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="prk-cm2-title" value="CM-2 · Conceptual model: versi modul dan kesiapan sesi (PKG-15 C4, PKG-16, PKG-17)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="4" width="1500" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-ses" value="&lt;b&gt;Sesi&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=27;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="240" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-ses-a" value="&lt;i&gt;rincian: CM-1&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm2-ses"><mxGeometry x="0" y="27" width="240" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-rb" value="&lt;b&gt;RekamanBukti&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=27;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="170" width="240" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-rb-a" value="&lt;i&gt;abstrak: tanggal, bukti [*], keterangan;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;peran pelapor. CM-1 Tata Kelola&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm2-rb"><mxGeometry x="0" y="27" width="240" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-pk" value="&lt;b&gt;PemeriksaanKesiapan&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=27;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="60" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-pk-a" value="waktu_periksa: DateTime&lt;br&gt;keputusan: KeputusanKesiapan&lt;br&gt;/tepat_waktu: Boolean" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm2-pk"><mxGeometry x="0" y="27" width="280" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-bp" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;«abstract»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;ButirPemeriksaan&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=42;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEF6FF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="230" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-bp-a" value="hasil: HasilButir&lt;br&gt;keterangan: Text [0..1]" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm2-bp"><mxGeometry x="0" y="42" width="280" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-bu" value="&lt;b&gt;ButirUtilitas&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=27;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="420" width="190" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-bu-a" value="kategori: KategoriUtilitas" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm2-bu"><mxGeometry x="0" y="27" width="190" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm2-bsk" value="&lt;b&gt;ButirStasiunKerja&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=cente