tyle="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm4-rtl-pe"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-rtl-psl" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=10;exitX=0.2;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.4;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prk-cm4-rtl" target="prk-cm4-psl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="920" y="880"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-rtl-psl-l0" value="*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm4-rtl-psl"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-rtl-psl-l1" value="1 pic" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm4-rtl-psl"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-pe-psl" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#444444;fontSize=10;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.85;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="prk-cm4-pe" target="prk-cm4-psl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1130" y="902"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-pe-psl-l0" value="*" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm4-pe-psl"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-pe-psl-l1" value="1 penilai" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="prk-cm4-pe-psl"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Notasi&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick 2024, Bab 8–11)&lt;br&gt;• Hanya konsep, atribut primitif, dan asosiasi: &lt;b&gt;tanpa method, tanpa detail Odoo&lt;/b&gt;, tanpa atribut &lt;code&gt;*_id&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Garis polos = asosiasi; label di ujung = &lt;i&gt;peran&lt;/i&gt; + multiplisitas. Belah ketupat hitam = komposisi (bagian–keseluruhan).&lt;br&gt;• Segitiga kosong biru = generalisasi; nama miring «abstract» = konsep abstrak.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/nama&lt;/code&gt; = atribut/asosiasi turunan (dihitung, hanya dibaca); panah terbuka = asosiasi turunan satu arah.&lt;br&gt;• Kotak abu-abu putus-putus = konsep yang dirinci di halaman/dokumen lain. (O) = lapis Pelengkap.&lt;br&gt;• Tipe primitif: Date, DateTime, Jam, Natural, Real, Persen, Boolean, String, Text, URL, Berkas, Interval&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; (CM-1)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="950" width="640" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Keputusan pemodelan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Respons tanpa asosiasi ke Personel&lt;/b&gt;: anonim (AB-PRK-28, KNF-PRK-04).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Jawaban&lt;/b&gt; abstrak menggeneralisasi asosiasi ke ButirSurvei; skala dan terbuka punya atribut berbeda (§9.2.1).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;PenetapanSurvei&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;EvaluasiSurvei&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;PenilaianEfektivitas&lt;/b&gt; = kejadian (§9.3.2). &lt;code&gt;/status&lt;/code&gt; Survei = siklus_selesai bila setiap RTL dinilai; dievaluasi bila ada evaluasi; ditetapkan bila ada penetapan; selain itu draf. Pembatalan penetapan (O) menghapus PenetapanSurvei.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/status_buka&lt;/code&gt; dari masa_buka dan hari ini (§9.3.1)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="950" width="560" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-n3" value="&lt;b&gt;Turunan dan invarian&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/response_rate&lt;/code&gt; = /jumlah_responden ÷ populasi; &lt;code&gt;/rerata&lt;/code&gt; = rerata JawabanSkala butir itu.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/survei_berikutnya&lt;/code&gt; = survei periode sesudahnya dengan jenis_responden sama.&lt;br&gt;• RTL &lt;code&gt;/rerata_sebelum&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;/rerata_sesudah&lt;/code&gt; = rerata aspek RTL di survei ini / survei berikutnya (AB-PRK-30).&lt;br&gt;• Penetapan: tiap aspek ≥ 1 butir skala, ≥ 1 butir terbuka, populasi &amp;gt; 0, target terisi, penetapan.tanggal &amp;lt; masa_buka.awal, penetap berwenang (AB-PRK-26).&lt;br&gt;• Respons hanya dalam masa_buka (AB-PRK-28). Evaluasi setelah masa_buka.akhir (AB-PRK-29).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;/kriteria_tertinggi&lt;/code&gt; = K1–K4 berurutan (AB-PRK-34)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1280" y="950" width="460" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="prk-cm4-n4" value="Bahan kerja (tidak masuk proposal). Sumber: kamus DTO dan katalog operasi ssd-praktikum.md; AB-PRK-01–34 expanded-use-case-praktikum.md; kontrak-core.md (16 Nov 2026). Rincian: rancangan/conceptual-model-praktikum.md · Draf 16 Nov 2026 · Herrens" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1165" width="1220" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>